# ACL Mosquitto — Control de acceso por usuario
#
# bridge (Django mqtt-bridge): acceso de lectura/escritura total sobre topics esp32
user bridge
topic readwrite esp32/#
topic read $SYS/#

# esp32 (dispositivos físicos): solo sus propios topics
user esp32
topic write esp32/+/telemetry/#
topic write esp32/+/notifications
topic write esp32/+/commands/request
topic read  esp32/+/commands/response
